This licenses the code in this repository only. It does not cover, and is not
compatible with, models the app downloads on first use:

- Coqui XTTS-v2 (voice cloning) — Coqui Public Model License, NON-COMMERCIAL only
- Language models pulled via Ollama (e.g. Qwen, Llama) — each under its own
  publisher's license; check before any commercial use
- The MediaPipe face-landmark model — Apache 2.0

None of these are bundled in this repository; the app downloads them directly
from their publishers on first setup, and each remains under its own license.
